- "Quantum coherence may play a role in fine-tuning conscious states" [GH-03A6BFC4C1E7 L8].  
- "Systems that maximize both complexity and energy dissipation at criticality may be the most likely to support consciousness" [GH-03A6BFC4C1E7 L11].  

**## Speculation**  
